## Why This Is Asked
Synchronization primitives are core at scale; a tree-based barrier tests deep concurrency understanding, memory ordering, and NUMA behavior without trivial spin-waits.

## Key Concepts
- Tree-based barrier with per-node atomic counters
- Sense-reversing style to avoid extra barriers
- Padding to avoid false sharing; memory_order_acq_rel on updates
- Dynamic sizing: grow to next power of two

## Code Example
